<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Real Glass & Water: every text a player reads, in Simplified Chinese, translated from en.xml (the
  source for every translation). Made with AI: corrections from native speakers are welcome.

  To translate: copy en.xml, name it with the game's code for your language (de.xml, es.xml,
  fr.xml, ko.xml, pl.xml, pt.xml, ru.xml, zh.xml), set code and name below, and translate the
  text between the tags. Leave the keys alone.

  - {0}, {1}... are filled in by the mod (a number, a name). Keep every one of them.
  - A long text can be wrapped over several lines here: the break reads as one space. So in
    Chinese, a text is wrapped only right after a \n (the spaces around a \n are dropped).
  - \n is a real line break (used in the dialogs).
  - A key missing from a translation shows in English, so a partial translation works.

  The game's own words: asset = 资产, Asset Editor = 资产编辑工具, Content Manager = 内容管理器,
  Snapshot tool = 快照工具, info view = 信息视图, mod = 模组. Glass = 玻璃, a pane = 玻璃板,
  a storey = 楼层. LOD stays LOD. The mod's name stays in English.
-->
<Language code="zh" name="简体中文">

